      "text": "TranscodingWorker\n\nDownload raw file & run FFMPEG\nCheck copyright & Community violations\nTranscode into different resolutions\nCreate  HLS segments of each resolution\nCreate thumbnail of video\nUpload to S3 transcoded videos, segments &\nmanifest file\nReport success/failure\nDelete raw file",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "7wamv_nE7XjLfXMjPVX_g",
      "originalText": "TranscodingWorker\n\nDownload raw file & run FFMPEG\nCheck copyright & Community violations\nTranscode into different resolutions\nCreate  HLS segments of each resolution\nCreate thumbnail of video\nUpload to S3 transcoded videos, segments & manifest file\nReport success/failure\nDelete raw file",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
